{
    "title": "Black and Decker IR02V-T Power Cord Replacement",
    "last_updated": "October 3, 2023",
    "estimated_time": "15 - 25 minutes",
    "difficulty": "Moderate",
    "introduction": "This guide demonstrates how to replace a Black & Decker IR02V-T flat iron power cord. A guide like this is crucial because any internal damage to your power cord could lead to a short circuit and would ruin the flat iron.\nWhen completing the process ensure the flatiron is unplugged and has completely cooled down.",
